Out of scope for the calculator, if on the student return:

* Alternative Minimum Tax (AMT) owed
* Charitable contribution carryforwards
* Net Operating Loss (NOL) carryforwards
* Form 2555 (Foreign Earned Income)
* Income from sources from American territories excluded by bona-fide resident
* Foreign nonresident
* Dual-status alien
* SALT cap reduced due to high AGI

If Form 2555 is on the return of the parent of a student subject to Kiddie Tax,
the entered parent taxable income must follow the instructions for line 6 of Form 8615.

